# PM Codex — settings for the local server (source/server.mjs).
# Pinokio sets these for you from the app's Configure tab. You only need this
# file's names if you start the server by hand, for example:
#   GEMINI_API_KEY=your-key npm start
#
# Optional. Turns on the Gemini features. Never put it in the page or in git.
GEMINI_API_KEY=""
# Optional. The port the app runs on. Default 7800.
PM_CODEX_PORT=""
